    "body": "Thank you, this looks good!\r\n\r\nI pushed a commit https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10174/commits/8722bd010c8c2bf5d25c20b1e5a308e1b142e211 with minor fixes:\r\n\r\n- I noticed that the matrix in transform() was outside of the `<li>`. This was an already-existing problem with transform(), not related to your changes. But, I wanted to fix it at the same time as part of this PR.\r\n\r\n- I fixed the spacing around your changes in setTransform(). This sort of thing is very minor and doesn't matter much, so I didn't want to delay merging the PR any further by requesting that you fix it. But it's good to be consistent. So I just fixed it myself.\r\n\r\nThanks again for your help!",
